                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "4604a1d4-b47a-4e36-a5f0-b7200417103b",
                        "entry_id": "35a76c57-d2ef-354f-9c13-7f8be77e0c2a",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "retentissantes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fa6d84a9-e50a-35bd-892e-73cf3e13066e",
                        "entry_id": "35a76c57-d2ef-354f-9c13-7f8be77e0c2a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui retentit."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "243333f0-63cc-4d17-b30c-198869ea99bc",
                                "sense_id": "fa6d84a9-e50a-35bd-892e-73cf3e13066e",
                                "text": "Il sollicita le garçon d’un timbre retentissant, en cognant bruyamment ses vastes pattes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "34fba3b7-e55c-4150-9033-dff54653dcfc",
                                "sense_id": "fa6d84a9-e50a-35bd-892e-73cf3e13066e",
                                "text": "Cédric était plongé dans ses rêveries, quand il en fut tout à coup tiré par le son retentissant' d’un cor, […]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7d57d2fe-131e-4a00-a352-8a294e5d092a",
                                "sense_id": "fa6d84a9-e50a-35bd-892e-73cf3e13066e",
                                "text": "Par notre Dieu Kô ! s’écria le bushman d’une voix retentissante, vous seriez homme à attendre que le Gariep ne précipite plus ses eaux retentissantes dans cet abîme !"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "de1106b6-c80d-42a3-afa4-c0228e45a4b4",
                                "sense_id": "fa6d84a9-e50a-35bd-892e-73cf3e13066e",
                                "text": "La fête se termina par des réjouissances bruyantes : musique, sonneries de clairons, roulements de tambours, fantasias échevelées, décharges retentissantes d’artillerie et de mousqueterie, — une orgie de couleurs, de mouvement et de bruit."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ac24975a-7a81-4812-93a4-59037d66b263",
                                "sense_id": "fa6d84a9-e50a-35bd-892e-73cf3e13066e",
                                "text": "Après plusieurs essais écrits dans la même veine, il sort en 1996 à compte d’auteur un retentissant pamphlet, Les Mythes fondateurs de la politique israélienne, qui lui vaut le soutien de l'abbé Pierre, un ami de longue date, et un procès pour injure raciale et négation de crime contre l’humanité […]."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7a49a0c8-3bc0-4d84-bbd4-c72f8c0c45d2",
                        "source_entry_id": "35a76c57-d2ef-354f-9c13-7f8be77e0c2a",
                        "source_sense_id": "fa6d84a9-e50a-35bd-892e-73cf3e13066e",
                        "target_lang_word": "resounding",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "resounding",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e1227fa7-8ce2-338b-b4ae-7595b667cbbf",
                                        "entry_id": "5aaeafd0-ee24-3cfe-936f-c734414a35ec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having a deep, rich sound; mellow and resonant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7723e090-94f4-3c85-8afd-ef5fb7f77420",
                                        "entry_id": "5aaeafd0-ee24-3cfe-936f-c734414a35ec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That causes reverberation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "120e3555-dfe5-4220-8deb-a9e27a4650c9",
                                                "sense_id": "7723e090-94f4-3c85-8afd-ef5fb7f77420",
                                                "text": "He suddenly gave her a resounding kiss, which embarrassed me even more than his violence had done."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "544a6926-a0f8-3d12-85c0-7a1a7b0fc701",
                                        "entry_id": "5aaeafd0-ee24-3cfe-936f-c734414a35ec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Emphatic, noteworthy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3e961667-14c2-4a97-8af2-501274b5194b",
                                                "sense_id": "544a6926-a0f8-3d12-85c0-7a1a7b0fc701",
                                                "text": "We had a resounding win against the rival team."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f14635e7-b480-4dbe-9c97-16dd34f37ebc",
                                                "sense_id": "544a6926-a0f8-3d12-85c0-7a1a7b0fc701",
                                                "text": "On this assessment, whatever one's personal criticisms, the Southern Region's booklet Want to Run a Railway? must be acknowledged a resounding success."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc47ee59-1322-468e-9803-020ca537fb1a",
                                                "sense_id": "544a6926-a0f8-3d12-85c0-7a1a7b0fc701",
                                                "text": "Mr. Serra has managed to coax two legendary European actors out of retirement for the production: 79-year-old Ingrid Caven, Rainer Werner Fassbinder’s wife and muse, plays an exiled French duchess and notorious libertine, and 73-year-old Helmut Berger, who appeared in several of Luchino Visconti’s films, takes the role of a freethinking German duke. But despite the big names attached, “Liberté” is a resounding failure."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "resounding",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a7e28f3b-f96a-3d0f-a90e-2d4f58d30d1a",
                                        "entry_id": "fb455f4f-77d9-3fb5-a68a-7deab552ff32",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "gerund of resound"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of",
                                            "gerund"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "02fc48e1-092d-4756-b548-03a111cbbcd7",
                                                "sense_id": "a7e28f3b-f96a-3d0f-a90e-2d4f58d30d1a",
                                                "text": "A tense hush — similar to those intervals of electrical stillness that separate the resoundings of a thunderstorm — fell upon the room."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
